1
00:00:05,732 --> 00:00:06,762
(Scene:)Mrs. Davis.

2
00:00:06,766 --> 00:00:08,796
(knocking)
Guess who?

3
00:00:08,801 --> 00:00:10,001
(Mrs Davis:)Dr. Cooper.

4
00:00:10,003 --> 00:00:12,103
(Sheldon:)That's right, good job.

5
00:00:13,106 --> 00:00:14,806
(Sheldon:)Hello.

6
00:00:14,807 --> 00:00:16,907
(Sheldon:)Uh, you wanted
to see me?

7
00:00:16,909 --> 00:00:18,539
(Mrs Davis:)Yes. Uh, welcome back.

8
00:00:18,544 --> 00:00:20,014
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

9
00:00:20,013 --> 00:00:22,683
(Sheldon:)I assume you'd like
to reopen our dialogue

10
00:00:22,682 --> 00:00:25,412
(Sheldon:)about the university forcing me
to continue with string theory?

11
00:00:25,418 --> 00:00:27,088
(Mrs Davis:)You mean the dialogue that went,

12
00:00:27,086 --> 00:00:30,426
"Please?" "No." "Please?" "No."
"Please?" "No."

13
00:00:31,391 --> 00:00:33,421
(Sheldon:)That's the one.

14
00:00:34,861 --> 00:00:38,231
(Sheldon:)I believe you went last,
so, uh, please?

15
00:00:38,231 --> 00:00:42,031
(Mrs Davis:)Dr. Cooper, while you were away,
we came up with a solution

16
00:00:42,035 --> 00:00:44,365
(Mrs Davis:)that would allow you to change
your field of study.

17
00:00:44,370 --> 00:00:46,100
(Sheldon:)Wow.

18
00:00:46,105 --> 00:00:49,105
(Sheldon:)Pouting and running away
actually worked.

19
00:00:50,143 --> 00:00:52,143
Yeah, I must say,
that may not be a lesson

20
00:00:52,145 --> 00:00:53,375
(Sheldon:)you want to reinforce with me.

21
00:00:55,148 --> 00:00:57,218
(Sheldon:)So, um, what is the solution?

22
00:00:57,216 --> 00:00:58,916
(Mrs Davis:)Currently, you're being paid
under a grant

23
00:00:58,918 --> 00:01:00,818
(Mrs Davis:)to specifically research
string theory.

24
00:01:00,820 --> 00:01:02,720
(Mrs Davis:)If we promote you
to junior professor,

